      "geometry": "rect",
      "text": "Solution – Digital Worker:\n\nOracle Developer Twin automates much of the repetitive preparation work between a ticket and implementation. It helps teams turn a requirement into a clearer action plan, identify likely impacted areas, prepare stronger AI-ready prompts, bring testing and accessibility guidance earlier, and keep human review in control before the work is finalized.\n   reduces manual ticket-to-code preparation with 7-stage guided planning\n   highlights likely impact and regression areas and hardens prompts\n   prepares stronger prompts for coding assistants while keeping devs in control\n   brings testing and accessibility checks earlier in the flow\n   keeps human approval in the final decision\n",
